{"1753140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flying Universe", "steam_appid": 1753140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​AD 2099:​​ Extraterrestrial armadas have crushed human civilization, with the last survivors clinging to existence in the subterranean stronghold known as ​​&quot;Deepfort&quot;​​. On the brink of annihilation, ​​Dr. Roar​​ sacrifices his life to activate a temporal device, catapulting Commander ​​Loy​​ back to ​​AD 2070​​ with one critical mission: to locate eight saviors ​​whose unique talents resonate with the core systems of the alien warships​​.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your destiny is to unite these final beacons of hope, command the ultimate battleship ​​&quot;Dawnbreaker&quot;​​, and storm the war-torn frontlines of ​​AD 2170​​. On this cataclysmic battlefield where humanity’s fate hangs in the balance, wield your wisdom and courage to ​​rekindle the last spark of human civilization​​.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​AD 2099:​​ Extraterrestrial armadas have crushed human civilization, with the last survivors clinging to existence in the subterranean stronghold known as ​​&quot;Deepfort&quot;​​. On the brink of annihilation, ​​Dr. Roar​​ sacrifices his life to activate a temporal device, catapulting Commander ​​Loy​​ back to ​​AD 2070​​ with one critical mission: to locate eight saviors ​​whose unique talents resonate with the core systems of the alien warships​​.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your destiny is to unite these final beacons of hope, command the ultimate battleship ​​&quot;Dawnbreaker&quot;​​, and storm the war-torn frontlines of ​​AD 2170​​. On this cataclysmic battlefield where humanity’s fate hangs in the balance, wield your wisdom and courage to ​​rekindle the last spark of human civilization​​.</p>", "short_description": "Survive the apocalypse your way. Choose between deep strategic campaign or classic arcade mode. With 16 heroes, vast customization, and a unique Bonding System, unlock 216 endings across over 6 billion procedurally generated challenges. This is survival, redefined.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753140/5ccbd40e5d586f91a50ae6d0b58b7da2f57da749/header.jpg?t=1782484940", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753140/5d71c7b39d597e9d600e65038a7bb9510cfae601/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782484940", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753140/5d71c7b39d597e9d600e65038a7bb9510cfae601/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782484940", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bitWindows7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> IntelCorei3-4340/AMDFX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GeForce GTX6602GB/AMD Radeon HD78502GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 128 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> 任意</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 酷睿i57500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> gtx1050TI4g<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 128 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> 任意</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements